 "notes": "CardDemo's admin menu (transaction CA00, program COADM01C): it lists the six options of COADM02Y and XCTLs to the chosen program; an option outside 1-6 or zero is refused (OPTION is a NUM field, which a 3270 cannot key letters into, so no scenario types a non-numeric option, #5116). Options 5 and 6 (COTRTLIC, COTRTUPC) belong to CardDemo's optional DB2 module, which the base CSD (app/csd/CARDDEMO.CSD, named by the case) does not define, so their XCTL raises PGMIDERR and the program's HANDLE CONDITION label answers 'This option is not installed ...'. Derived from CardDemo (Apache-2.0; Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates): LICENSE and NOTICE here are the source's own."
}
